{"ref":"BDB, כַּ֫חַשׁ","hw":"כַּ֫חַשׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כַּ֫חַשׁ</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 16:8\" href=\"/Job.16.8\">Jb 16:8</a></sup> <strong>1. lying 2. leanness</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:1\" href=\"/Hosea.12.1\">Ho 12:1</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּ֑חַשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:13\" href=\"/Hosea.10.13\">Ho 10:13</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחֲשִׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:8\" href=\"/Job.16.8\">Jb 16:8</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחֲשֵׁיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:3\" href=\"/Hosea.7.3\">Ho 7:3</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>lying</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲכַלְתֶּם פְּרִי כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:13\" href=\"/Hosea.10.13\">Ho 10:13</a> <em>ye have eaten the fruit of lying;</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:3\" href=\"/Hosea.7.3\">7:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רָעָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:1\" href=\"/Hosea.12.1\">12:1</a>; of Nineveh, <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳ פֶּרֶק מְלֵאָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:1\" href=\"/Nahum.3.1\">Na 3:1</a> <em>of lying</em> (and) <em>robbery</em> it is <em>full;</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:13\" href=\"/Psalms.59.13\">ψ 59:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָלָה</span>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  of Job’s affliction <a data-ref=\"Job 16:8\" href=\"/Job.16.8\">Jb 16:8</a> <em>my leanness hath risen up against me</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:24\" href=\"/Psalms.109.24\">ψ 109:24</a>; 𝔗 J <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:27\" href=\"/Genesis.41.27\">Gn 41:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 12:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.12.5\">Ec 12:5</a>; Talm. <span dir=\"rtl\">כחשׁא</span>; > <em>my lying</em>, i.e. my affliction regarded as a lying witness, Di Buhl al.)","next":"BDB, כֶּחָשׁ","prev":"BDB, כָּחַשׁ"}